<title>CANADA: Unitel renamed AT&amp;T Canada.</title>
<headline>Unitel renamed AT&amp;T Canada.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitel Communications Co has been renamed AT&amp;T Canada Long Distance Servcies Co, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Canada said with the name change the company can have access to the technology and other innovation of the parent company while also taking advantage of its Canadian resources.</p>
</text>
